  "description": "Deep dive: running median with two heaps, sliding window median with lazy deletion, IPO and other sort-one-key-heap-the-other greedies, merge k sorted lists, smallest range covering k lists and k pairs with smallest sums, with steppers and Go/C++/Java/Python templates.",
  "hero": {
